[48] 000

[49] Visit the [Triple Zero website](https://www.triplezero.gov.au/triple-zero/How-to-Call-000) for information including information on the Emergency+ Smartphone application.

[50] Under commonwealth and state laws, it is an offence to misuse the 000 emergency services number. Action will be taken against those who misuse or make nuisance calls on the 000 line.

[51] 131 444

[52] Callers to 131 444 will be asked to press '1' on their phones if they require a police officer to attend an incident now.

[53] If you need to report an incident that does not require immediate police attendance or for general information you will be asked to press '2'.

[54] Calls to 131 444 from most regional areas are automatically directed to the nearest police station.